{"parse": {"title": "PD-06", "pageid": 144775, "text": "<div class=\"mw-parser-output\"><div class=\"tabber no-indent\"><div class=\"episode-inter-nav\"><a href=\"/wiki/PD-05\" title=\"PD-05\"><img alt=\"Btn zuo.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/18px-Btn_zuo.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"18\" height=\"26\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/27px-Btn_zuo.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/36px-Btn_zuo.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"64\" data-file-height=\"92\" /></a><span class=\"nav-page-name\">PD-06</span><a href=\"/wiki/PD-07\" title=\"PD-07\"><img alt=\"Btn zuo.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/18px-Btn_zuo.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"18\" height=\"26\" class=\"img-rotate\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/27px-Btn_zuo.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/36px-Btn_zuo.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"64\" data-file-height=\"92\" /></a></div><div class=\"episode-panel\"><div style=\"position: relative; padding-left: 35px;\"><div class=\"episode-deco\"><div class=\"episode-deco-1\"></div><div class=\"episode-deco-2\"></div><div class=\"episode-deco-3\"></div></div><div class=\"episode-index\"><span class=\"episode-index-chapter\">PD</span><span class=\"episode-index-number\">06</span></div><h2 style=\"position:absolute; opacity:0; pointer-events:none;width:0; height:0; overflow:hidden;\"><span id=\".E2.80.9C.E5.8F.8D.E8.AE.B0.E5.BF.86.E2.80.9D.E4.B9.8B.E5.AE.B6\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"“反记忆”之家\">“反记忆”之家</span></h2><div class=\"episode-title\"> “反记忆”之家</div><div class=\"episode-subtitle\">Home of Forgotten Memories</div></div><div><div class=\"episode-navbar\"><div class=\"tabber-filter auto-first\" style=\"display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; margin: 0 -4px;\"></div></div></div></div><div class=\"episode-switchbtn\"><small style=\"color: #999;\">头像 <div class=\"switchbtn\" style=\"display: inline-block;\"><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyHeadicon mw-customtoggle-\"><img alt=\"显示\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/20px-Btn_watch_nor.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"显示\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/30px-Btn_watch_nor.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/40px-Btn_watch_nor.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyHeadicon mw-customtoggle-\" style=\"display: none;\"><img alt=\"隐藏\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/20px-Btn_watch_selected.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"隐藏\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/30px-Btn_watch_selected.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/40px-Btn_watch_selected.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i></div></small> <small style=\"color: #999;\">背景图 <div class=\"switchbtn\" style=\"display: inline-block;\"><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyBg mw-customtoggle-\"><img alt=\"显示\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/20px-Btn_watch_nor.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"显示\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/30px-Btn_watch_nor.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/40px-Btn_watch_nor.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyBg mw-customtoggle-\" style=\"display: none;\"><img alt=\"隐藏\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/20px-Btn_watch_selected.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"隐藏\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/30px-Btn_watch_selected.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/40px-Btn_watch_selected.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i></div></small></div><div class=\"episode-desc\"><div style=\"display:flex;\"><div style=\"flex-grow:1;\"><span class=\"color-value\"></span>有<span class=\"color-value\"></span>人<span class=\"color-value\"></span>在<span class=\"color-value\"></span>纪<span class=\"color-value\"></span>念<span class=\"color-value\"></span>，<span class=\"color-value\"></span>他<span class=\"color-value\"></span>们<span class=\"color-value\"></span>便<span class=\"color-value\"></span>忘<span class=\"color-value\"></span>记<span class=\"color-value\"></span>自<span class=\"color-value\"></span>身<span class=\"color-value\"></span>已<span class=\"color-value\"></span>死<span class=\"color-value\"></span>去<span class=\"color-value\"></span>。<span class=\"color-value\"></span></div><div class=\"grey-small hide-m\" style=\"float:right;\">ID: 38510107</div></div></div><div class=\"battle-panel\"><div class=\"story no-indent\"><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-s02_bg_02.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"s02_bg_02\"><img alt=\"s02_bg_02\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/da/Cg-s02_bg_02.png/600px-Cg-s02_bg_02.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/da/Cg-s02_bg_02.png/900px-Cg-s02_bg_02.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/da/Cg-s02_bg_02.png/1200px-Cg-s02_bg_02.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>一阵金色的辉光乍现在空中，转瞬之间，三个人影掉落在了金色的原野上。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"652902.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/11/HeadIconSmall-652902.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-652902.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"652902.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/11/HeadIconSmall-652902.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-652902.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/11/HeadIconSmall-652902.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-652902.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">维尔汀：</div><div>呼……呼……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">小梅斯梅尔：</div><div>逃到这里应该没事了……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>小梅斯梅尔回头看去，后面并没有什么人追过来。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">小梅斯梅尔：</div><div>地震了？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"652902.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/11/HeadIconSmall-652902.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-652902.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"652902.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/11/HeadIconSmall-652902.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-652902.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/11/HeadIconSmall-652902.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-652902.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">维尔汀：</div><div>不……展览馆那边来了个大家伙。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>一台有着圆形头部、颀长双臂的机器人从展览馆中径直冲了出来。它站在原地等待了一会儿，便开始四处搜寻。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>——那三百六十度无死角转动的圆形头部正在机警地查看着四周。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">小梅斯梅尔：</div><div>那是什么？！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>猛然，似乎是定位到了访客们遥远的身影，巨型机器人向三人奔去。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">X：</div><div>哈……看起来，现在的处境较刚才更加危险了。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">X：</div><div>不过，好消息是，那边有一栋建筑物。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>X指了指远方，一栋陈旧的俄式小楼矗立在金色原野中，仿佛正随风摇曳。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"652902.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/11/HeadIconSmall-652902.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-652902.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"652902.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/11/HeadIconSmall-652902.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-652902.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/11/HeadIconSmall-652902.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-652902.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">维尔汀：</div><div>我们去那儿藏身。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>访客们压低身形，匆匆向那栋小楼跑去。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"305716.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/4c/HeadIconSmall-305716.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-305716.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"305716.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/4c/HeadIconSmall-305716.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-305716.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/4c/HeadIconSmall-305716.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-305716.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">小梅斯梅尔：</div><div>快，蹲下来！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>俄式小楼的后院墙外，院落的栅门已经斑驳，藤蔓植物攀援于上。</div></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-s02_bg_05.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"s02_bg_05\"><img alt=\"s02_bg_05\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/5d/Cg-s02_bg_05.png/600px-Cg-s02_bg_05.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/5d/Cg-s02_bg_05.png/900px-Cg-s02_bg_05.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/5d/Cg-s02_bg_05.png/1200px-Cg-s02_bg_05.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>三个小小的身影慢慢凑近，在愈加靠近的巨型机器人的脚步声中，悄悄进入大门。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>三人将耳朵抵在门上，仔细辨认着门外的声响。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>砰！！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"652902.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/11/HeadIconSmall-652902.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-652902.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"652902.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/11/HeadIconSmall-652902.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-652902.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/11/HeadIconSmall-652902.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-652902.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">维尔汀：</div><div>……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>砰！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"305715.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/0f/HeadIconSmall-305715.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-305715.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"305715.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/0f/HeadIconSmall-305715.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-305715.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/0f/HeadIconSmall-305715.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-305715.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">小梅斯梅尔：</div><div>……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>门外的声音逐渐消失，那巨型机器人似乎停止了动静，访客们也不敢动弹。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">小梅斯梅尔：</div><div>……它应该走远了。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>气氛终于缓和了下来，三个人倚着门坐到了地上。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">X：</div><div>派出这样大的机器人来追捕，是不是有些太夸张了？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>X摆摆手，开始观察起他们藏身的屋子来。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"650814.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/c5/HeadIconSmall-650814.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-650814.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"650814.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/c5/HeadIconSmall-650814.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-650814.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/c5/HeadIconSmall-650814.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-650814.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">X：</div><div>内部整洁，生活气息浓厚……墙面上还有除霉的痕迹……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>年轻的访客们在无人的建筑中小心前行着。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">小梅斯梅尔：</div><div>但这里的住户们呢？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"652902.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/11/HeadIconSmall-652902.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-652902.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"652902.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/11/HeadIconSmall-652902.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-652902.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/11/HeadIconSmall-652902.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-652902.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">维尔汀：</div><div>这栋房子给人的感觉有些奇怪，就好像……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>X拉开一台粉红色的冰箱，但里面并没有金属触手，只有需要保鲜的食品——没拆封的曲奇、白糖、黄油……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">X：</div><div>这里完全没有跟机器人相关的设施，而且所有食物都没有拆封，像是与外界脱轨了几十年，而且……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>年轻的访客扭头，清点起了房屋的摆设。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"650816.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/c6/HeadIconSmall-650816.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-650816.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"650816.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/c6/HeadIconSmall-650816.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-650816.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/c6/HeadIconSmall-650816.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-650816.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">X：</div><div>一副农用犁耙、三根油画棒……以及数量多到离奇的闹钟、几根针筒和一瓶男士古龙水？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">X：</div><div>这些看上去并不像一家人的居住痕迹……倒不如说，更像是将十几个人的生活拼凑在了一起。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"652902.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/11/HeadIconSmall-652902.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-652902.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"652902.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/11/HeadIconSmall-652902.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-652902.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/11/HeadIconSmall-652902.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-652902.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">维尔汀：</div><div>但这里又有很多私人物品，信件、家族合影，还有……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"652502.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/a8/HeadIconSmall-652502.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-652502.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"652502.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/a8/HeadIconSmall-652502.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-652502.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/a8/HeadIconSmall-652502.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-652502.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">啁啾表：</div><div>“我开始录了，妈妈，你说吧！”</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"305712.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/51/HeadIconSmall-305712.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-305712.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"305712.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/51/HeadIconSmall-305712.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-305712.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/51/HeadIconSmall-305712.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-305712.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">小梅斯梅尔：</div><div>什么声音？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"652902.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/11/HeadIconSmall-652902.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-652902.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"652902.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/11/HeadIconSmall-652902.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-652902.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/11/HeadIconSmall-652902.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-652902.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">维尔汀：</div><div>是这枚类似怀表的东西……似乎在马克西姆身上见过。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"652502.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/a8/HeadIconSmall-652502.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-652502.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"652502.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/a8/HeadIconSmall-652502.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-652502.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/a8/HeadIconSmall-652502.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-652502.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">啁啾表：</div><div>“不要担心，我在这里恢复得很好，病房里的同志们都会相互帮助，因此没什么困难的地方。”</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"652502.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/a8/HeadIconSmall-652502.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-652502.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"652502.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/a8/HeadIconSmall-652502.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-652502.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/a8/HeadIconSmall-652502.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-652502.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">啁啾表：</div><div>“还有我的事，妈妈！我很想你……爸爸……已经一个月了……”</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"652502.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/a8/HeadIconSmall-652502.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-652502.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"652502.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/a8/HeadIconSmall-652502.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-652502.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/a8/HeadIconSmall-652502.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-652502.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">啁啾表：</div><div>“我记得，小松鼠，下次来探望的时候，记得把那只娃娃带过来，就是穿花裙子的那个，在阳台上——”</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>怀表不再发出任何声音了。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">小梅斯梅尔：</div><div>他们是这栋房子的主人吗？……这家人去哪里了？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"652902.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/11/HeadIconSmall-652902.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-652902.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"652902.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/11/HeadIconSmall-652902.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-652902.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/11/HeadIconSmall-652902.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-652902.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">维尔汀：</div><div>……不知道。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"650414.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/06/HeadIconSmall-650414.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-650414.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"650414.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/06/HeadIconSmall-650414.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-650414.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/06/HeadIconSmall-650414.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-650414.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">？？？：</div><div>阳台上的东西可多了去了，娃娃压根儿不在这里。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>上膛的声音从背后响起，X想回头确认一下情况，却随即被喝止。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"650414.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/06/HeadIconSmall-650414.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-650414.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"650414.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/06/HeadIconSmall-650414.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-650414.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/06/HeadIconSmall-650414.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-650414.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">？？？：</div><div>别动！举起手，然后转过来。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>年轻的访客们小心翼翼地举起了双手，向后转去，一名神情稍有紧张的老妇人正举着一把猎枪对着三人。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"652902.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/11/HeadIconSmall-652902.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-652902.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"652902.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/11/HeadIconSmall-652902.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-652902.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/11/HeadIconSmall-652902.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-652902.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">维尔汀：</div><div>请别开枪，女士，我们只是……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">？？？：</div><div>叫我塔玛拉。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">塔玛拉：</div><div>外国小孩，真是少见。上次我见到做坏事的小孩还是在“瘟疫”之前……可惜，他们本不该因为“瘟疫”死掉的。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">塔玛拉：</div><div>能把炸肉包吸引过来，你们是偷钢筋了？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>老妇人警惕地盯着三人。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">塔玛拉：</div><div>哦——我明白了，你们就是季娜说的那几个变数……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">塔玛拉：</div><div>现在，把情况解释给我听吧，坦诚相见才是乖孩子的行为。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>年轻的访客们惊讶地相视一眼，随后，X站了出来。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">X：</div><div>我来解释，塔玛拉女士。</div></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-s02_bg_05.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"s02_bg_05\"><img alt=\"s02_bg_05\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/5d/Cg-s02_bg_05.png/600px-Cg-s02_bg_05.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/5d/Cg-s02_bg_05.png/900px-Cg-s02_bg_05.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/5d/Cg-s02_bg_05.png/1200px-Cg-s02_bg_05.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">X：</div><div>就是这样，塔玛拉女士，我保证我说的话绝无半句虚假。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">塔玛拉：</div><div>我了解了。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">塔玛拉：</div><div>又是一群卷入了不该卷入的争端的傻孩子，虽然我怀疑你们可能没说实话。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">X：</div><div>……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">塔玛拉：</div><div>不过，把三个小孩当作恐怖分子，炸肉包这类的机器人还发了狂似的来堵截你们，这个国家的人真是疯了！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">塔玛拉：</div><div>我很同情你们，但我今天还有更重要的事要做……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">塔玛拉：</div><div>考虑到你们也是来避难的，怎么样，想不想在这栋建筑多藏一会儿？等我把事都做完了，可以找人帮你们处理外面那个圆脑袋。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">塔玛拉：</div><div>只不过——这里是纪念那些死于“瘟疫”的好姑娘、好小伙的地方，是我们的纪念馆，你们可别乱碰。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>三人面面相觑。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">塔玛拉：</div><div>或者你们想立刻就走——当然，我也不会拦着。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">小梅斯梅尔：</div><div>我们……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">X：</div><div>我们很乐意接受您的好意，塔玛拉女士。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>小梅斯梅尔还未说完，X便打断了她，同时朝她斜了斜眼睛，示意她不要轻举妄动。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>她往X斜眼的方向望去，发现他指向的是塔玛拉女士的猎枪。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">X：</div><div>而且，单凭我们三个……现在也对付不了炸肉包，不如乖乖承认现状，对吗，维尔汀？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"652902.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/11/HeadIconSmall-652902.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-652902.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"652902.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/11/HeadIconSmall-652902.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-652902.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/11/HeadIconSmall-652902.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-652902.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">维尔汀：</div><div>……有道理。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"652902.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/11/HeadIconSmall-652902.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-652902.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"652902.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/11/HeadIconSmall-652902.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-652902.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/11/HeadIconSmall-652902.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-652902.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">维尔汀：</div><div>我们留下来帮你，塔玛拉女士。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">塔玛拉：</div><div>聪明的小孩，放心，我不会对你们怎么样。现在，来看看——</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>“铃——”</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>一阵突兀的闹铃声响起，塔玛拉转头，看向房间内的数十个闹钟，不一会儿就定位到了吵闹声的来源。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>她走到一个老旧的闹钟前，叹了一口气，伸手往下一按，闹钟便立马闭上了嘴。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">塔玛拉：</div><div>……这里虽然是座纪念馆，但纪念的都是活生生的普通人——比如，拥有大量闹钟的这一位。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">塔玛拉：</div><div>这些闹钟的拥有者是奥莉加·索科洛娃，一位23岁的护士姑娘……虽然她每天神经兮兮的，但人还算实诚，只不过维护她的遗物可费功夫。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>“铃——”闹钟的声音又从房内的某处响了起来。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">闹钟：</div><div>“28号病床该换药了！”</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>塔玛拉的手熟练地越过闹钟的森林，安抚了那只在窗台上躁动的定时器。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">小梅斯梅尔：</div><div>为什么……她需要这么多闹钟？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">塔玛拉：</div><div>唉，这姑娘，总是害怕自己忘记各种事，所有的闹钟都用来提醒自己给病人换药、打针……但还是不够用。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">塔玛拉：</div><div>后来，连她自己也住进了医院，给我留下这么个烂摊子。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">X：</div><div>这只闹钟看起来最为老旧。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>X拿起一个最老旧的儿童闹钟，塑胶的颜色都泛着陈旧的黄色。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"650401.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/fc/HeadIconSmall-650401.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-650401.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"650401.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/fc/HeadIconSmall-650401.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-650401.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/fc/HeadIconSmall-650401.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-650401.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">塔玛拉：</div><div>对，这就是最初的那只闹钟。一会儿它就要响了，这也是今天我会来的原因。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>众人不约而同地安静了下来，等待着闹钟响起。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">儿童闹钟：</div><div>“生日快乐，萨沙，第20次。”</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"650401.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/fc/HeadIconSmall-650401.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-650401.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"650401.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/fc/HeadIconSmall-650401.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-650401.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/fc/HeadIconSmall-650401.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-650401.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">塔玛拉：</div><div>好了，关掉它吧，萨沙是她的女儿，早就死在那场“瘟疫”里了……真快啊，如果还活着，应该已经20岁了。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>塔玛拉拿起了随手摆放在墙角的扫帚。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"650410.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/55/HeadIconSmall-650410.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-650410.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"650410.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/55/HeadIconSmall-650410.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-650410.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/55/HeadIconSmall-650410.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-650410.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">塔玛拉：</div><div>孩子们，过来这儿帮把手。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>年轻的访客们跟着塔玛拉来到房间的另一边——一个风格截然不同的角落。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">小梅斯梅尔：</div><div>一整面的工具墙，看来这家人很喜欢自己做手工。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">塔玛拉：</div><div>不止呢，手工台下的筐子里还放着各种玩具和电子设备的零件……安德烈和万尼亚就喜欢这个。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>三人走近，塔玛拉一手拿着扫帚，一手从旁边的塑料袋中掏出几块抹布，分给了年轻的访客们。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">塔玛拉：</div><div>来吧孩子们，早点打扫完，就能早点去处理外面那个铁疙瘩。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">塔玛拉：</div><div>再过一阵子，我弄几个机器人过来，让这帮老朋友看看，我们的国家如今都发展成什么样子了。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>三人接过抹布，默契地走向工具墙。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">X：</div><div>这也是您一直维持着……这些遗物原貌的原因吗？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>塔玛拉扫着台子上的落尘，停下来扶了扶腰。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">塔玛拉：</div><div>是啊。可是这里就是个“衣冠冢”……真正的故居已经不成样子啦。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">塔玛拉：</div><div>我老了，越老越回忆起从前的事……大家都走得太急了，我一样东西都扔不掉，就只好拿到这里了。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">塔玛拉：</div><div>季娜骂我傻，呵呵……但她也没反对啊。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>塔玛拉倒干净簸箕里的灰，翻开了门后的挂历。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"650410.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/55/HeadIconSmall-650410.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-650410.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"650410.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/55/HeadIconSmall-650410.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-650410.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/55/HeadIconSmall-650410.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-650410.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">塔玛拉：</div><div>“瘟疫”盛行的时候，我们嘴上不说，可心里真觉得人类是不是要因此完蛋了？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"650401.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/fc/HeadIconSmall-650401.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-650401.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"650401.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/fc/HeadIconSmall-650401.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-650401.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/fc/HeadIconSmall-650401.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-650401.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">塔玛拉：</div><div>但即使如此，也没任何一个人颓废，所有人都在努力活着，试图活得比太阳更长、更久……直到见到这场灾难的结束，人们的生活再次回到正轨。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"650401.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/fc/HeadIconSmall-650401.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-650401.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"650401.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/fc/HeadIconSmall-650401.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-650401.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/fc/HeadIconSmall-650401.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-650401.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">塔玛拉：</div><div>我们都说，谁比我们苏联人更能挺过寒冬？我们相互帮助，相互鼓气，用最热切的希望温暖彼此颤抖的双手。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"650401.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/fc/HeadIconSmall-650401.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-650401.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"650401.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/fc/HeadIconSmall-650401.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-650401.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/fc/HeadIconSmall-650401.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-650401.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">塔玛拉：</div><div>“不要哭泣，把种子种下吧，我们会收获硕果。”我们一遍遍地说。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"650411.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/35/HeadIconSmall-650411.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-650411.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"650411.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/35/HeadIconSmall-650411.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-650411.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/35/HeadIconSmall-650411.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-650411.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">塔玛拉：</div><div>可有些人就是永远留在了那个冬天。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>小梅斯梅尔闷着头，不停地擦着餐具柜的玻璃门，那里已经光洁如新。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"652902.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/11/HeadIconSmall-652902.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-652902.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"652902.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/11/HeadIconSmall-652902.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-652902.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/11/HeadIconSmall-652902.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-652902.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">维尔汀：</div><div>塔玛拉女士，节哀。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">塔玛拉：</div><div>唉，其实都过去这么多年了，连哀伤的心情都变淡了。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">塔玛拉：</div><div>只是偶尔会想，如今的生活这么幸福，他们却永远都看不到了。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>塔玛拉走到手工台旁，拿起了一个相框。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>相框中，一名身穿背带裤、满身油污的男子抱着一个小男孩，小男孩手中则举着一个玩具机器人。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"650411.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/35/HeadIconSmall-650411.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-650411.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"650411.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/35/HeadIconSmall-650411.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-650411.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/35/HeadIconSmall-650411.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-650411.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">塔玛拉：</div><div>安德烈和小万尼亚要是活着，看到这个铁块满地走的世界，一定会高兴的。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"650412.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/65/HeadIconSmall-650412.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-650412.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"650412.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/65/HeadIconSmall-650412.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-650412.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/65/HeadIconSmall-650412.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-650412.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">塔玛拉：</div><div>孩子的妈妈……阿扎利亚也会开心的。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>小梅斯梅尔回头望了一眼塔玛拉，轻叹了一口气。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>雾气弥漫在透明的玻璃上，小梅斯梅尔若无其事地将它抹去，开始擦起别的地方。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>塔玛拉将相框放了回去。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">小梅斯梅尔：</div><div>……奇怪。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"652902.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/11/HeadIconSmall-652902.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-652902.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"652902.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/11/HeadIconSmall-652902.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-652902.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/11/HeadIconSmall-652902.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-652902.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">维尔汀：</div><div>怎么了？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>小梅斯梅尔举起塔玛拉刚放下的相框。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"305712.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/51/HeadIconSmall-305712.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-305712.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"305712.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/51/HeadIconSmall-305712.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-305712.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/51/HeadIconSmall-305712.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-305712.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">小梅斯梅尔：</div><div>塔玛拉女士，我们在聚合物国际峰会上见过这个人——</div></div></div></div></div></div>", "categories": [{"sortkey": "", "category": "没有战斗的章节", "hidden": true}, {"sortkey": "", "category": "章节"}], "displaytitle": "PD-06"}}